	(text "1) serial termination isnt that neccesary in this application\n2) some IC have STB internal pull down , its still better to add external one\n3) 120Ohm resistor and a switch to add or remove parallel termination\n4) 2 bidirectional tvs protection to the input connector\n5) shutdown pin must be pulled up if not used"
